SCHOOL OF CHINESE MEDICINE
CLINICAL DIVISION
Research Assistant/Senior Research Assistant (Sleep and Mental Health Research) (25260330)
Project Introduction:
The School of Chinese Medicine at HKBU is dedicated to advance sleep and mental health research. Our research focuses on developing and evaluating the efficacy of various novel interventions for the treatment of sleep and mental disorders, drawing on traditional Chinese medicine (e.g., Chinese herbal medicine & acupuncture), exercise science (e.g., Tai Chi), and psychotherapy (CBT-I). Our work has led to multiple publications in top-tier journals, including the BMJ , the Lancet Child & Adolescent Health , British Journal of Sports Medicine , and more.
More information about our work: https://scholars.hkbu.edu.hk/en/persons/danny-yu/
