(b) provide leadership in strengthening local and international partnerships to advance research and education goals;
(c) develop scholarly initiatives by fostering collaboration, securing external funding, and enhancing innovative, high-impact interdisciplinary research;
(d) mentor junior faculty in teaching, research and service excellence;
